WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
- Wait, speaking of strip,
you went to my show.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:02.963
- [Matt] Yes, I did.

00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:03.870
- I was like, you said you were gonna come

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.490
and then I didn't know if
you really would, you did.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.080
- Oh, no, I was on top of it.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.620
I bought tickets to your
last show of the residency.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.453
- [Kelly] That was a fun one.

00:00:11.453 --> 00:00:12.286
- Because I knew that was the one

00:00:12.286 --> 00:00:13.119
that was really gonna give.

00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:14.563
I was like, they were all gonna give,

00:00:14.563 --> 00:00:16.440
but I was like, I know

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.420
that you're gonna whip out the classics.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.994
Is that me sobbing at your show?

00:00:19.994 --> 00:00:20.827
- Is that the one?

00:00:20.827 --> 00:00:22.770
Wait, is that the one that
I did "Happier Than Ever?"

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.701
Is that the?

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:24.534
- You did "Happier Than Ever."

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:25.367
You did "Sober."

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:26.200
- Yeah.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.033
That's for real fans.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:27.866
- [Matt] Yeah.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:29.580
- And then you did, I didn't know this,

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.070
but, so I had, of course,
memorized the set list

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.000
before we got, by the way,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.155
I brought like 13, 14 of my friends.

00:00:35.155 --> 00:00:35.988
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:39.456
I'm not kidding, we went
as a Gay Army to your show.

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:40.289
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:40.289 --> 00:00:42.930
So, we went and I had like
memorized the set list

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.390
and I knew at the end
when you were gonna stop

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.290
before the encore.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.102
So I was like, I can go to the bathroom.

00:00:48.102 --> 00:00:52.950
At this theater, the men's
room was in Timbuktu.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:56.131
I'm going, and I hear just,

00:00:56.131 --> 00:00:57.570
♪ What if I told you ♪

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.940
And I'm like, she's not
doing "A Moment Like This."

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.466
She had never done "A Moment
Like This" in the show

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:02.510
- I never do "A Moment Like This."

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.343
- [Guest] Really?

00:01:03.343 --> 00:01:04.830
- She surprised did "A Moment Like This."

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.945
I peed faster and harder.

00:01:07.945 --> 00:01:09.210
(audience laughs)

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.170
- And then you were running.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.520
- And I was sprinting back.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.200
And also it's like you're pretty,

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.270
let's say hydrated when you're in Vegas.

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.103
You know what I mean?
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:18.600
- There was a lot of stuff that was drunk,

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.490
so I had to go so bad, but I was like,

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.410
let me make it back for
"A Moment Like This."

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.240
And then I got there and I sobbed.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.170
- I love the video.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.093
No, you're so..
- [Matt] I was really

00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:27.240
crying hard.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.650
- [Guest] I mean, anytime you sing, I cry.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.580
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:32.580
Well, I never, I never sing
that one generally just,

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:33.413
yeah.
- Yeah, I know,

00:01:33.413 --> 00:01:35.010
and that's why I was so
surprised you were doing it,

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:36.750
because I know you traditionally don't.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:37.583
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:38.490
- And so then I was like, come on,

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.380
I'm literally at the urinal

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.547
screaming to my friend
Patrick, "We have to go!

00:01:42.547 --> 00:01:44.379
"We're not washing our hands!"

00:01:44.379 --> 00:01:47.940
Like it was, I will
cop to being unhygienic

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.800
when it comes to getting
back to the seats.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.120
- [Kelly] Oh, if I'm running
back in somewhere, yes.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.050
- Yeah, no, it's just.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.670
- Or it's usually my kid at a movie.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:54.503
They're like, "I've gotta pee."

00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:55.640
Are you serious?

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.230
- I know, but you put on
such an incredible show.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.120
I mean, obviously it was you guys,

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.328
you are adding new shows, right?

00:02:01.328 --> 00:02:02.580
- We are.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.657
That's announced, right?

00:02:03.657 --> 00:02:04.651
Yes, yes.

00:02:04.651 --> 00:02:06.510
(audience clapping)

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:07.343
Yes.

00:02:07.343 --> 00:02:08.176
We are.

00:02:08.176 --> 00:02:09.811
We did, we added a couple, I think.

00:02:09.811 --> 00:02:12.150
But I'm always like, what
am I allowed to talk about?

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:12.983
I always forget.

